WEBVTT

NOTE Translation of the automatically transcribed German captions.
Human review of wording and timing is required before claiming WCAG media conformance.

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
Crow Backup makes it easy to back up
your files over the internet

00:06.000 --> 00:12.120
on your friends' computers.

00:12.120 --> 00:16.880
They can store their backups
on your computer in return.

00:16.880 --> 00:21.340
Your data stays encrypted
the whole time.

00:21.340 --> 00:28.400
Neither your friends nor anyone else
can view your files.

00:28.400 --> 00:35.860
Unlike a backup in the cloud,
you stay in control of your data.

00:35.860 --> 00:40.500
And you don't have to pay
for Crow Backup.

00:40.500 --> 00:47.960
You don't need to handle external drives:
your data is stored safely with your friends.

00:47.960 --> 00:52.420
Even when a little accident happens.

00:52.420 --> 01:01.280
Focus on the important things in life.

01:01.280 --> 01:04.980
With Crow Backup.

